    "title": "KoalaBear fixed-literal guarded logarithmic numerator exclusions",
    "status": "PROVED",
    "closure": "three exact homogeneous numerator-route intersections",
    "statement": "The guarded irreducible degree-67 logarithmic numerator has empty named-open intersection with the surviving cubic/J11 route in F05-R02, F07-R02, and F06-R20. Exact homogeneous Horner evaluation of V^15 N(-U/V) gives degree-39 remainders on the two R02 routes and a degree-41 remainder on F06-R20. After each remainder is adjoined, the complete transported named localizer reduces to zero at factor 15. Hence all three intersections are empty over the deployed field and all extensions. Timed-out F05-R20 and F06-R02 batch attempts, and the incomplete F07-R20 attempt, are not used as proof claims.",
